    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Poolside Laguna is a small, text-only line with two versions, both released in July 2026 and both publishing open weights. Every version supports reasoning, so the family is aimed at tasks that benefit from step by step thinking rather than plain chat alone. Context windows run from 262144 to 1048576 tokens, and the newest version, Laguna S 2.1, offers the larger window and a max output of 131072 tokens, which suits long documents and extended generated answers. The trade off is price and scale. Laguna S 2.1 costs $0.09 per million input and $0.18 output, while Laguna XS 2.1 is cheaper at $0.06 and $0.12 with a smaller 262144 token window and 32768 token output. Input and output are text only, so image, audio and video work are out of scope. No benchmark rows are given, so quality cannot be judged from these facts.",
